  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/theme/RuiShape.kt
    - Continuous-corner ("squircle") shape algorithm adapted from miuix's
      miuix-squircle module (Path.addSquircleRect).
    - Modified: re-exposed as a Compose Shape (SmoothCornerShape) integrated
      with Rui's theme tokens instead of miuix's modifier API; extended with
      a top-edge-only variant (TopSmoothCornerShape) for surfaces docked to
      the screen's bottom edge, using the same corner math.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/utils/RuiOverscroll.kt
  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/utils/RuiScrollEndHaptic.kt
  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/utils/SpringUtils.kt
    - Bounce-overscroll, scroll-end haptics and the damping/spring settle
      math adapted from miuix's Overscroll.kt / ScrollEndHaptic.kt /
      SpringUtils.kt.
    - Modified: removed pull-to-refresh coordination and the theme-level
      overscroll factory; renamed to Rui's modifier convention.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/BlurBackdrop.kt
    - Backdrop-capture mechanism (GraphicsLayer recording + coordinates
      translation) adapted from miuix's miuix-blur module
      (LayerBackdrop/LayerBackdropModifier).
    - Modified: heavily reduced - blur applies through Compose's
      cross-platform BlurEffect instead of miuix's AGSL/SkSL runtime-shader
      pipeline; no progressive blur, noise dither or highlights.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/components/RuiTopAppBar.kt
    - Collapsing large-title top app bar (RuiScrollBehavior /
      RuiTopAppBarState, the exit-until-collapsed nested-scroll connection
      and the collapsing bar layout) adapted from miuix's basic/TopAppBar.kt.
    - Modified: no subtitle or bottom-content slots and no small-bar pinning
      interplay; integrated with Rui's frosted bar background, typography
      and spacing tokens.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/components/RuiSlider.kt
    - Drag mechanics, progress/thumb springs and step haptics adapted from
      miuix's basic/Slider.kt.
    - Modified: no vertical or range variants, no key-point magnets or tick
      marks; iOS UISlider visuals (jump to touch, white thumb with shadow)
      on Rui's token system.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/components/RuiPullToRefresh.kt
    - Pull-to-refresh state machine, nested-scroll coordination, damped-drag
      physics (via Rui's SpringUtils port of miuix's SpringMath/SpringEngine)
      and the threshold haptic adapted from miuix's basic/PullToRefresh.kt.
    - Modified: no top app bar coordination, no LocalOverScrollState
      integration and no text labels; the indicator reuses RuiCircularProgress
      instead of a custom orbiting-dot canvas.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/components/RuiProgress.kt
    - Indeterminate circular mechanics (rotating arc with keyframed sweep)
      adapted from miuix's basic/ProgressIndicator.kt.
    - Modified: built on Compose Unstyled's UnstyledProgress for semantics;
      iOS-adjacent visuals (4dp capsule linear bar, thin ring, animated fill)
      on Rui's token system; no third orbiting-dot variant.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/utils/NavSettleEasing.kt
    - Duration-pinned navigation settle curve (underdamped spring step
      response baked into an Easing) adapted from miuix-nav's
      runtime/NavSettleEasing.kt (NavProgrammaticEasing).
    - Modified: internal to Rui, exposed as the navigationDriver motion
      token's default; no gesture-commit/cancel phase variants.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/components/RuiBadge.kt
    - BadgedBox placement math (corner-relative badge offsets, anchor-only
      baselines) adapted from miuix's basic/Badge.kt, following Material 3.
    - Modified: RuiBadge exposes a text/dot API instead of an arbitrary
      content slot; no placement rulers; sizes on Rui's token system.

